. Final recommendations depend on each student’s profile and current requirements.</p></div><div class="pathway-grid"><article class="pathway-card pathway-uk"><div class="pathway-image"></div><div class="pathway-content"><span class="pathway-label">01 · UNITED KINGDOM</span><h3>From curiosity to a focused shortlist.</h3><p>A student exploring data and technology begins with profile review, then compares course structure, location, affordability and career direction before applying.</p><div class="pathway-tags"><span>Profile review</span><span>Course fit</span><span>Application plan</span></div><a href="destinations/united-kingdom.php">Explore the UK pathway →</a></div></article><article class="pathway-card pathway-australia"><div class="pathway-image"></div><div class="pathway-content"><span class="pathway-label">02 · AUSTRALIA</span><h3>A plan that balances ambition and lifestyle.</h3><p>A business-focused student compares programme choices, city experience, budget and preparation timelines to make a confident decision.</p><div class="pathway-tags"><span>Budget clarity</span><span>Shortlisting</span><span>Preparation</span></div><a href="destinations/australia.php">Explore the Australia pathway →</a></div></article><article class="pathway-card pathway-canada"><div class="pathway-image"></div><div class="pathway-content"><span class="pathway-label">03 · CANADA</span><h3>Connecting a course to a career direction.</h3><p>An engineering aspirant looks beyond rankings to compare curriculum, skills, affordability and the support needed from application to arrival.</p><div class="pathway-tags"><span>Career direction</span><span>Course comparison</span><span>Visa readiness</span></div><a href="destinations/canada.php">Explore the Canada pathway →</a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="framework-section" id="framework"><div class="portfolio-container"><div class="portfolio-heading dark-heading"><p class="eyebrow">OUR FRAMEWORK</p><h2>Five questions behind<br/><em>every good plan.</em></h2></div><div class="framework-list"><div><span>01</span><h3>Who are you?</h3><p>Understand academic profile, strengths, goals and current readiness.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>What do you want to build?</h3><p>Connect the course choice to skills, employability and long-term direction.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>What fits your reality?</h3><p>Compare country, city, institution, budget, timeline and risk.</p></div><div><span>04</span><h3>What needs to happen next?</h3><p>Turn the shortlist into documents, applications and a responsible checklist.</p></div><div><span>05</span><h3>How will you grow from there?</h3><p>Keep arrival support, career readiness and confidence in view beyond admission.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="portfolio-proof"><div class="portfolio-container"><p class="eyebrow light">THE STANDARD WE AIM FOR</p><h2>Clear enough to act on.<br/><em>Honest enough to trust.</em></h2><div class="portfolio-proof-grid"><div><strong>Profile-based</strong><p>Recommendations begin with the person, not a generic destination list.</p></div><div><strong>Responsible</strong><p>We explain what is possible, pending or risky before the next decision.</p></div><div><strong>Long-term</strong><p>We keep career direction and life abroad in the conversation.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="portfolio-cta" id="counselling"><div><p class="eyebrow light">YOUR STORY STARTS WITH A QUESTION</p><h2>What could your<br/><em>next chapter look like?</em></h2></div><div><p>Bring us your goals, questions and maybe. We’ll help you shape the next responsible step.</p><a class="button button-accent" href="index.php#counselling">Book free counselling ↗</a></div></section></main><?php $basePath = ''; include_once __DIR__ . '/footer.php'; ?></div><script>const b=document.getElementById('menuButton'),n=document.getElementById('mobileNav');b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const o=n.classList.toggle('is-open');b.setAttribute('